  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>OllieTree Foundation(Ministry/Group)<br>橄榄树基金 (事工/团契)</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>-凝聚爱，传递爱，播种爱，见证爱.</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>橄榄树基金在行动，感谢您的支持和关注<br></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">其他项目和更新</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-4\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/community-run/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/4467-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/4467-225x300.jpg 225w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/4467-768x1024.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/4467-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/4467.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E8%AE%B2%E5%BA%A7/\">更多</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"232\" height=\"300\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/620-232x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/620-232x300.jpg 232w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/620-791x1024.jpg 791w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/620-768x994.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/620.jpg 1125w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 232px) 100vw, 232px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">详情</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/freeclinic/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"240\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/88-300x240.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/88-300x240.jpg 300w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/88-1024x819.jpg 1024w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/88-768x615.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/88.jpg 1402w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/community-run/\">详情</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>健康资讯（10/2026)</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>10月是一年中最值得主动防护的月份。我特别想劝大家，尤其是65岁以上老人、慢性病患者、孕妇和免疫功能较弱的人群：</p><p>第一，疫苗别拖。CDC建议6个月以上人群每年接种流感疫苗，最好在10月底前完成，因为身体需要约两周产生保护力；流感和新冠疫苗可同一次就诊接种。根据美国四家医学学会（儿科、家庭医师、妇产科、传染病学会）9月联合发布的本季指南，新生儿（母体未接种者）、孕32–36周孕妇、75岁以上及50–74岁高风险成人还应考虑RSV免疫保护。联邦推荐近来几经反复，但有一点从没变过：疫苗的主要价值是防重症、住院和死亡，而不是保证不感染——高风险人群请主动问医生，别等生病再后悔。</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/%E6%A9%84%E6%A6%84%E6%A0%91%E8%B5%84%E8%AE%AF/\">详情</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"644\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_32ec.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>我们正做的事</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>社区举办定期医疗讲座，免费普及医疗健康知识；</p><p>关怀社区老人、癌症病人，提供关爱、资源、协谈及帮助；</p><p>边远山区留守儿童中心帮助建立图书室及电脑室；</p><p>组织及协调医疗团队在社区及边远贫困山区进行义诊及医疗救助；</p><p>建立了橄榄树健康资讯公众号，为华人提供正确可靠、先进实用的健康信息。</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">加入我们</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>我们要做的事</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>建立专业全、技术好、质量高的橄榄树医疗团队定期为社区及贫困地区提供免费医疗服务及医疗帮助；</p><p>建立为山区留守儿童提供生活、生理、心理及心灵需要的全方位辅助模式，从一户、一村、一城镇开始；</p><p>建立以基督为中心，用爱心、关怀、服务为管道，来传播基督的爱和福音的橄榄树事工团队；</p><p>与各教会及福音机构、及有爱心的社会团体协作和合作，为大使命竭力工作。&nbsp;</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">加入我们</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/sparkler-677774_1280-1024x682-1.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>橄榄树基金的优势</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><span>专业的医疗人材</span></h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t我们专业的医疗团队经过多年的学习和实践。多数仍然在医疗前线工作。他们是我们最坚实的中间力量，也是最有价值的财富。\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><span>纯正的目标</span></h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t我们秉持公开、透明、开放的原则，建立橄榄树基金非盈利组织。我们从开始就把荣神益人为己任。我们同时兼顾短期效果和长期规划。\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><span>从脚踏实地开始</span></h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t我们的同工紧贴生活，感受社区需要。从美国到中国积极向社区向边远山区最有需要的人提供我们的帮助，从专业知识到物资投入，做雪中送炭的橄榄树.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>橄榄树基金 润泽四方\n</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>橄欖樹基金會 5公里 愛心跑</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Some of Our</h5>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>近期项目</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View all Projects</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/19-06-17-07-55-15-2502-1024x768-1.jpg\" alt=\"19-06-17-07-55-15-2502-1024x768\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/19-06-17-07-55-10-2501-1024x576-1.jpg\" alt=\"19-06-17-07-55-10-2501-1024x576\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/IMG_1259.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1259\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/03/2021-3-20.jpeg\" alt=\"2021-3-20\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/10/IMG_2248.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2248\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
}